    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "diagram-3e478a9d-b35b-414f-8535-4c4a9543bb1c",
        "kind": "diagram",
        "ownerId": "project-fca6d9b3-8760-406f-bef7-e6c8e48344a4",
        "name": "01 Stakeholder needs",
        "documentation": "",
        "properties": {
          "diagramKind": "requirements",
          "markdown": "## NEED-001 Capture and revisit useful links\n\nStakeholder: link owner. Save a URL with recognizable metadata, retain it locally, and reopen it later. Inferred from the existing implementation; not a separately approved stakeholder baseline.\n\n## NEED-002 Organize and retrieve a personal library\n\nLink owner: assign reusable groups, inspect nonhidden links, and sort saved links by title. Inferred from source; requires stakeholder review before becoming an approved baseline.\n\n## NEED-003 Control casual visibility of sensitive links\n\nDevice owner: keep hidden links out of the normal list and require device-owner authentication at selected UI entry points. This is a visibility need, not a claim of per-record encryption. Inferred from source; requires stakeholder review before becoming an approved baseline.\n\n## NEED-004 Recognize links in a comfortable presentation\n\nLink owner: customize symbols and colors and control title and caption line limits. Inferred from source; requires stakeholder review before becoming an approved baseline.\n\n## NEED-005 Reuse links outside the app\n\nLink owner and recipient: open supported web URLs, share URL values, and copy or share QR images. Inferred from source; requires stakeholder review before becoming an approved baseline.\n\n## NEED-006 Retain editable link details locally\n\nLink owner: persist edits, relationships, visibility and reminder intent across launches without an application backend. Notification delivery is not implemented. Inferred from source; requires stakeholder review before becoming an approved baseline.\n"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T17:38:58.810Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T17:42:40.243Z"
      },
